  <h1>Typing Race</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Letters flash on screen — type each one before it vanishes in this keyboard warm-up.</p>
  <p>Typing Race is a bite-sized keyboard sprint from the Laughing Dragons workroom. Letters appear one at a time; hit the matching key before time runs out. Clear a Heat of twenty correct letters to earn SORT-COLOR-6.</p>
  <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#game-play">Play now ↓</a> · <a href="#game-guide">Full guide ↓</a></p>
